WEBVTT

00:00.570 --> 00:02.850
I'm gonna hunt down all the fieldasaurus!

00:02.850 --> 00:06.540
<i>This town has transformed considerably.</i>

00:03.940 --> 00:05.000
No, I will.

00:05.000 --> 00:07.150
Their raw materials are mine.

00:08.680 --> 00:11.110
I'll have to mediate fights again.

00:11.340 --> 00:13.230
Hey, Rud.

00:13.230 --> 00:15.150
You're looking pale.

00:15.150 --> 00:16.570
Boo. Gurly.

00:17.050 --> 00:21.170
It must be tough having to deal with this 
right after becoming clan leader.

00:21.170 --> 00:24.930
Shouldn't you get someone 
to help you run things?

00:24.930 --> 00:29.170
Yeah. I've actually got a request 
for you two regarding that.

00:31.130 --> 00:34.270
Welcome back. Was there another fight?

00:34.270 --> 00:35.090
Yeah.

00:35.440 --> 00:39.420
You can get good materials from 
fieldasaurus to use in potions and weapons.

00:40.610 --> 00:43.060
It's no wonder everyone flocks to them.

00:43.290 --> 00:48.580
We'll need to recruit people to 
help us manage the clan after all.

00:48.580 --> 00:49.520
You're right.

00:50.200 --> 00:54.490
Manicia is handling the office work, 
but I can't push her too hard.

00:55.460 --> 00:57.450
I tried asking Lilia, but...

00:58.050 --> 01:01.410
Sorry, but I don't know enough 
to teach someone else.

01:02.030 --> 01:04.370
Why not try to cooperate with other clans?

01:04.620 --> 01:06.550
Cooperate, huh?

01:06.550 --> 01:10.670
It'd be best if you could form an alliance.

01:11.000 --> 01:13.660
In this case, you'd want an equal alliance.

01:13.660 --> 01:18.510
If you have to answer to them, it'd defeat the
point of establishing a new clan in this town.

01:18.510 --> 01:20.680
<b>Equal Alliance</b>

01:18.510 --> 01:20.680
<b>Clan Leader A</b>

01:18.510 --> 01:20.680
<b>Clan Leader B</b>

01:18.510 --> 01:20.680
<b>Subordinate Relationship</b>

01:19.110 --> 01:24.080
But they're not likely to agree to that
unless you offer them something beneficial.

01:20.600 --> 01:25.230
<b>Clan Leader A</b>

01:20.600 --> 01:25.230
<b>Clan leader B</b>

01:24.080 --> 01:25.230
Right.

01:25.590 --> 01:29.310
After all, our clan only consists
of Nin, Luna, Manicia, and me.

01:29.870 --> 01:34.220
If only you had something 
to offer right away...

01:36.130 --> 01:37.490
Lily?

01:37.770 --> 01:42.090
Something we can offer right away, huh?

01:42.090 --> 01:44.220
All we have to offer is combat strength.

01:45.280 --> 01:50.570
But all I've told people is 
that we drove off the guardian,

01:50.570 --> 01:52.580
in part, so we can protect Marius.

01:52.580 --> 01:53.420
Right.

01:53.870 --> 01:58.880
Which means we need someone
 to help manage the clan.

01:59.840 --> 02:02.980
I've been doing what I can
 since I spoke with Lilia.

02:05.030 --> 02:08.640
I knew you'd make a good clan leader.

02:08.640 --> 02:12.820
At this rate, we might become 
a big clan sooner than we expect.

02:12.820 --> 02:15.160
Why do you sound so disappointed?

02:15.160 --> 02:17.490
Because if that happens...

02:19.100 --> 02:23.350
We'll have less alone time.

02:33.600 --> 02:34.840
Rud.

02:36.510 --> 02:41.140
If we struggle to find people 
to help us manage the clan,

02:41.570 --> 02:45.100
you can use me to help promote it.

02:45.440 --> 02:47.850
I can't do that. You wouldn't like it.

02:49.790 --> 02:51.570
Rud, you're so...

02:53.000 --> 02:55.900
Rud, I want you to manage the labyrinth.

02:56.240 --> 02:57.820
Huh? What are you two up to?

02:57.820 --> 02:58.780
Nothing.

02:59.570 --> 03:03.250
I told you, I'm not doing that.
 I'm busy right now.

03:03.250 --> 03:06.830
Then, I'll become a clan member
 and stop fights.

03:07.080 --> 03:09.170
That's not the only thing I'm busy with.

03:09.170 --> 03:12.450
Anyway, should a labyrinth guardian
 be wandering around so much?

03:12.450 --> 03:13.290
It's not an issue.

03:13.700 --> 03:17.970
So you don't have a grudge 
against humans or anything like that?

03:19.510 --> 03:21.420
Are you really asking me that?

03:21.420 --> 03:22.560
I knew it.

03:22.560 --> 03:24.040
So there <i>is</i> something.

03:25.360 --> 03:26.600
Nope, nothing at all.

03:27.140 --> 03:30.680
So let me help you while 
you manage the labyrinth.

03:32.030 --> 03:35.810
Fine. I'll allow you to become a member.

03:35.810 --> 03:39.160
Tell me about managing a labyrinth.

03:39.160 --> 03:41.360
Sure thing. Let's get started.

03:44.570 --> 03:47.530
I never said I'd actually manage it...

04:00.050 --> 04:09.890
<b>The Strongest Tank's Labyrinth Raids</b>

04:00.050 --> 04:09.890
<b>Labyrinth Raids</b>

04:00.050 --> 04:09.890
m 124 277 l 134 267 140 274 144 272 150 275 163 260 177 271 472 271 488 261 502 275 507 270 510 274 518 267 528 277 516 288 526 298 517 306 510 299 506 304 500 299 489 312 473 302 178 302 163 313 150 300 146 303 140 299 134 306 125 297 134 287

04:00.050 --> 04:09.890
A Tank with a Rare 9,999 Resistance Skill 
Got Kicked from the Hero's Party

05:20.540 --> 05:22.160
Shut up. I'm going in there.

05:22.160 --> 05:23.920
You're gonna take all my materials.

05:30.290 --> 05:31.840
In here, Rud.

05:34.000 --> 05:35.950
You manage the labyrinth from here?

05:35.950 --> 05:37.040
That's right.

05:38.090 --> 05:40.810
This lake displays the 
interior of the labyrinth.

05:40.810 --> 05:45.590
You can use it to place monsters and
 change the labyrinth's construction.

05:47.100 --> 05:49.120
That number at the top is your points.

05:49.120 --> 05:54.080
You can spend points to 
create and replicate monsters.

05:54.690 --> 05:56.750
Do the points increase on their own?

05:57.330 --> 06:03.200
You gain points over time and by 
depleting the absorb shields of adventurers.

06:04.440 --> 06:10.400
I see. So if my absorb shield suffered 
massive damage, could I earn more points?

06:10.400 --> 06:12.180
Oh, hey, that's a good idea.

06:12.620 --> 06:14.390
Could you show me how it works?

06:14.660 --> 06:15.850
Sure.

06:16.180 --> 06:17.850
You're replicating a goblin?

06:18.120 --> 06:20.350
I'll summon one within the labyrinth.

06:24.000 --> 06:27.110
Hey, you'll chase off the adventurers.

06:28.080 --> 06:31.150
Can you replicate monsters 
other than goblins?

06:31.150 --> 06:34.660
Yeah. The monsters we can
 currently replicate are:

06:34.660 --> 06:40.620
goblins, axe orcs, 
chameleon kongs, and fieldasaurus.

06:40.940 --> 06:45.880
Monsters can only be replicated
 from originals you've created.

06:46.410 --> 06:52.640
If you build trust with the monsters, 
they might help you in your time of need.

06:52.990 --> 06:54.670
They may even take a liking to you.

06:54.670 --> 06:56.640
Monsters can take a liking to people?

06:57.670 --> 07:01.560
Wait, this costs a <i>million</i> points?
 We can't create that.

07:01.910 --> 07:05.020
Right. That's when you use 
one of these grimoires.

07:05.560 --> 07:10.240
This allows you to create a monster
 at random. It's like gacha.

07:10.640 --> 07:12.110
Wanna try?

07:18.750 --> 07:19.790
<b>Ta-</b>

07:18.750 --> 07:19.790
<b>da!</b>

07:19.780 --> 07:21.040
A slime?

07:19.790 --> 07:20.080
<b>Ta-</b>

07:19.790 --> 07:20.080
<b>da!</b>

07:20.080 --> 07:20.330
<b>Ta-</b>

07:20.080 --> 07:20.330
<b>da!</b>

07:20.330 --> 07:21.040
<b>Ta-</b>

07:20.330 --> 07:21.040
<b>da!</b>

07:23.470 --> 07:26.710
Not quite what I said earlier, 
but it instantly took a liking to you.

07:27.210 --> 07:30.810
Does this mean we can replicate slimes now?

07:30.810 --> 07:31.680
Yeah.

07:31.990 --> 07:37.480
With enough time, we might 
eventually get S-rank monsters.

07:38.800 --> 07:42.900
<i>Most of the adventurers 
come here for the fieldasaurus.</i>

07:43.820 --> 07:45.400
<i>The labyrinth's lively right now,</i>

07:45.400 --> 07:49.020
<i>but once the materials become 
widely available, activity will die down.</i>

07:49.820 --> 07:53.290
<i>This might allow us to spawn 
a variety of monsters in the labyrinth,</i>

07:53.290 --> 07:56.740
<i>and keep a steady number 
of adventurers coming.</i>

07:57.890 --> 08:01.080
<i>This will help me manage the clan, too.</i>

08:06.840 --> 08:08.840
We got 1,000 points from that.

08:09.170 --> 08:14.980
Hey, Rud. This might be a rare slime. 
We got real lucky creating it.

08:16.240 --> 08:20.140
Thanks, slime. You gave me a great idea.

08:20.760 --> 08:21.650
Marius.

08:21.650 --> 08:22.600
Huh?

08:22.840 --> 08:26.210
I'll take over managing 
the labyrinth from you.

08:26.210 --> 08:27.480
Huh? You mean it?

08:27.750 --> 08:29.970
I won't take the reins right away,

08:29.970 --> 08:33.740
but I'll think about what kind of labyrinth 
we should make to attract more adventurers.

08:34.140 --> 08:37.780
So could I ask you to manage the
 labyrinth for a little while longer?

08:37.780 --> 08:39.690
Fine with me.

08:40.780 --> 08:42.830
Wh-What should I do with this thing?

08:42.830 --> 08:46.730
It doesn't seem interested in me. 
Why don't you take it with you?

08:49.670 --> 08:51.260
What? A slime?

08:51.780 --> 08:53.180
It's all right, Luna.

08:53.180 --> 08:55.970
I, uh, picked it up at the labyrinth.

08:56.450 --> 08:59.720
Manicia, didn't you say once
 that you wanted a pet?

09:02.650 --> 09:06.960
It's cuter than the ones I've seen outside.

09:08.250 --> 09:09.430
It's adorable.

09:10.360 --> 09:15.580
Brother, if we're going to keep it 
as a pet, won't it need a name?

09:15.580 --> 09:17.280
You're right.

09:17.550 --> 09:25.870
Master, you settled on my name right away. 
Did you not put much thought into it?

09:25.870 --> 09:30.160
O-Of course I did. I chose something 
cute after giving it a lot of thought.

09:30.160 --> 09:34.590
You chose that name because there was a
 lunafia petal on your clothes, right?

09:34.920 --> 09:37.030
You chose it pretty quickly, huh?

09:37.800 --> 09:40.600
I-I know. How about Lime?

09:41.520 --> 09:43.520
It seems to like it.

09:43.520 --> 09:46.790
Great. Nice to meet you, Lime.

09:48.480 --> 09:51.760
I like how you look when you're distressed.

09:51.760 --> 09:53.180
Same here.

09:53.180 --> 09:54.940
Give me a break.

10:01.820 --> 10:04.080
The clan leader of Avancia?

10:04.500 --> 10:06.830
Why would we ally with 
a backwater clan like his?

10:07.660 --> 10:09.330
Boo, reject his request.

10:09.980 --> 10:11.250
No, wait.

10:14.150 --> 10:16.170
He seems like an interesting kid.

10:16.570 --> 10:20.210
Very well. The two great clans 
will be holding our ball soon.

10:20.950 --> 10:22.550
Send him an invitation.

10:20.950 --> 10:22.550
Send him an invitation.

10:26.700 --> 10:30.840
<i>Several days later, 
we arrived in the town of Keild.</i>

10:29.320 --> 10:30.840
Wow.

10:30.840 --> 10:33.690
This town is bigger than I imagined.

10:34.270 --> 10:36.990
Lilia and Lily, thanks for coming with us.

10:36.990 --> 10:40.410
No problem. It gives us a chance 
to say hello to our guild, too.

10:40.880 --> 10:43.140
I've never attended a ball before.

10:43.140 --> 10:45.260
Isn't it exciting, Sister?

10:46.800 --> 10:49.080
Rud, what are those flags for?

10:49.680 --> 10:54.110
As you can see, they're the flags of the 
Black Dragon Fang and White Tiger Claw.

10:54.110 --> 10:55.050
Huh...

10:55.320 --> 10:57.510
They both look pretty sharp.

11:00.810 --> 11:02.470
Looks like everyone's here.

11:02.880 --> 11:04.180
Take a look at these.

11:05.080 --> 11:07.560
They're invitations to a ball
 that's being held

11:07.560 --> 11:11.020
by the two major clans in Keild, 
the Black Dragon Fang and White Tiger Claw.

11:11.020 --> 11:13.290
That's incredible, dear brother.

11:13.290 --> 11:15.860
I'm not sure I understand, 
but I'm impressed, master.

11:16.310 --> 11:21.330
This isn't just an invitation for our 
clans to work nicely together, is it?

11:21.330 --> 11:23.580
What's the catch?

11:24.720 --> 11:28.130
As you surmised, they've rejected 
our request to form an alliance.

11:28.130 --> 11:30.830
They said they'd consider it 
if we served under them.

11:31.170 --> 11:32.290
I knew it.

11:32.840 --> 11:35.250
But that's not the only problem.

11:36.340 --> 11:40.000
They demanded Nin 
in exchange for their cooperation.

11:40.000 --> 11:40.970
They want Nin?

11:41.320 --> 11:43.570
Nin is famous as a saint.

11:43.570 --> 11:46.930
I've tried reaching out 
to some other clans, too,

11:47.270 --> 11:50.640
and most of them were keenly aware of Nin.

11:50.970 --> 11:52.850
I guess that means I'm popular.

11:53.620 --> 11:55.810
So what are you going to do?

11:56.320 --> 11:58.280
Will you trade me to them?

11:59.060 --> 12:01.670
If you want to go, I won't stop you.

12:01.670 --> 12:04.240
And what if I asked you to 
stop me, no matter what?

12:04.870 --> 12:06.200
I'd stop you, of course.

12:11.080 --> 12:15.380
Then, don't let me go. I don't intend 
to be part of any clan except this one.

12:16.720 --> 12:19.590
Got it. I'll reject that condition,
 no matter what.

12:23.050 --> 12:27.630
But I do plan to attend the ball in the 
knowledge that I'll be in enemy territory.

12:28.770 --> 12:33.230
Most of the guests will likely be affiliated with
 the Black Dragon Fang or White Tiger Claw.

12:33.770 --> 12:39.440
But I can't pass up this chance to speak directly
to representatives of the two major clans.

12:39.750 --> 12:42.800
You're right. You can't back out of this.

12:42.800 --> 12:44.990
Hm, you're going to Keild, huh?

12:44.990 --> 12:46.750
Keild... Keild...

12:46.750 --> 12:47.650
What is it?

12:47.650 --> 12:50.620
Oh, it's not all that important,

12:50.960 --> 12:55.670
but in my lake, I saw another labyrinth 
with a sentient guardian like me.

12:55.980 --> 13:00.130
It's called the Keild Labyrinth,
 like the town.

13:02.570 --> 13:04.220
That's <i>really</i> important!

13:04.220 --> 13:05.550
Oh, is it?

13:06.080 --> 13:11.620
<i>If I raid the Keild Labyrinth and 
acquire another one of those magic stones,</i>

13:12.270 --> 13:15.520
<i>I might be able to 
completely cure Manicia's illness.</i>

13:15.930 --> 13:17.810
The Keild Labyrinth...

13:17.810 --> 13:23.360
I've heard even the two major clans 
have only made it to the 50th floor.

13:23.870 --> 13:26.320
But we've grown from before.

13:26.980 --> 13:29.280
We've got Marius's more 
than satisfactory firepower.

13:29.730 --> 13:32.810
Luna's been practicing 
magic in her spare time.

13:32.810 --> 13:34.750
And Nin is an exceptional healer.

13:35.160 --> 13:37.140
We'll make a good party.

13:37.140 --> 13:39.710
So we'll be raiding a labyrinth 
and asking the clans for help.

13:40.230 --> 13:42.860
Sounds like this will be a fun trip.

13:43.760 --> 13:46.170
<i>I doubt either will be easy.</i>

13:46.920 --> 13:49.530
<i>But I'll do whatever it takes
 to form an alliance</i>

13:49.530 --> 13:51.830
<i>and acquire the Secret 
Treasure of the Labyrinth.</i>

13:57.560 --> 13:58.860
Thanks for waiting.

13:59.640 --> 14:02.240
Well? I look pretty good, don't I?

14:03.580 --> 14:05.150
Yeah, you do.

14:05.150 --> 14:07.610
I suggested Luna wear a dress, too, but...

14:07.980 --> 14:12.080
I-I thought this would be better.

14:15.170 --> 14:19.040
I'm sure you'd look good in a dress, 
but that maid outfit looks great on you, too.

14:19.260 --> 14:22.250
Th-Thank you.

14:22.560 --> 14:25.710
C'mon, sis, don't be shy.

14:26.140 --> 14:30.180
I don't really like girly clothes like these.

14:30.480 --> 14:32.940
It's fine. You look cute.

14:37.640 --> 14:39.430
Stop staring at me.

14:39.430 --> 14:40.480
You're going red.

14:40.480 --> 14:41.810
I said stop!

14:42.630 --> 14:44.560
How extravagant.

14:44.560 --> 14:49.280
All of this belongs to the 
Black Dragon Fang. Surprising, isn't it?

14:49.280 --> 14:53.540
Apparently, the White Tiger Claw
 owns a similar building.

14:53.540 --> 14:57.500
It's no wonder they reign
 over the other clans.

15:00.240 --> 15:02.540
Isn't that the Lady Saint?

15:02.540 --> 15:05.490
You're right. What's she 
doing at the clan ball?

15:05.490 --> 15:06.420
Don't you know?

15:06.800 --> 15:11.150
Apparently, her clan's going to join ours.

15:12.430 --> 15:13.770
What are they talking about?

15:13.770 --> 15:17.100
They make it sound like 
you represent our clan, too.

15:17.380 --> 15:20.060
Don't let them underestimate you, leader.

15:20.650 --> 15:23.020
We're going to change 
their opinion of us today.

15:23.670 --> 15:25.980
I intend to take care of that, but...

15:26.550 --> 15:29.950
<i>I expected it, 
but I feel uncomfortable here.</i>

15:30.300 --> 15:31.400
Hey, Rud.

15:31.780 --> 15:34.370
Am I allowed to eat that food over there?

15:34.650 --> 15:35.630
Uh, yeah.

15:35.630 --> 15:36.830
Really?

15:37.280 --> 15:40.460
Having Marius around really
diffuses the tension, doesn't it?

15:40.460 --> 15:42.730
Yeah. Should we get something to eat, too?

15:48.190 --> 15:50.720
Thank you all for coming today.

15:51.180 --> 15:54.470
I am Ike, sub-leader of 
the Black Dragon Claw.

15:54.470 --> 15:57.680
And I am Cynthia, 
sub-leader of the White Tiger Claw.

15:58.110 --> 16:02.140
<i>I thought their leaders 
would be greeting the guests.</i>

16:02.650 --> 16:05.610
Today, we've invited a special guest.

16:06.870 --> 16:08.070
Lady Saint.

16:08.540 --> 16:10.780
Could you come up here, please?

16:13.120 --> 16:17.200
Rud, they're inviting me to go up there,

16:17.570 --> 16:19.900
but I'm a member of your clan.

16:20.950 --> 16:22.080
You're right.

16:23.670 --> 16:27.430
I'm going to go complain.
 Will you come with me?

16:27.430 --> 16:28.170
Sure.

16:31.040 --> 16:36.390
Lady Saint, I never thought 
you'd actually become an adventurer.

16:36.680 --> 16:41.600
No? I've actually been wanting 
to focus on adventuring for a while.

16:41.600 --> 16:43.850
And who is this?

16:44.080 --> 16:45.370
Who's that guy?

16:45.370 --> 16:47.310
He's awfully friendly with the Lady Saint.

16:47.660 --> 16:48.150
He's—

16:48.150 --> 16:49.270
It is nice to meet you.

16:50.050 --> 16:53.490
I am the leader of Nin's clan, Rud.

16:53.830 --> 16:59.450
Ah, yes. Weren't you a 
member of the hero's party?

16:59.980 --> 17:03.160
I believe you were their tank, correct?

17:03.670 --> 17:07.130
Didn't the former hero call you useless?

17:08.320 --> 17:12.590
On several occasions, he asked 
for my advice on party composition.

17:12.990 --> 17:17.550
I suggested he kick his tank.

17:20.080 --> 17:23.430
I mean, you don't need 
a tank to raid labyrinths.

17:24.080 --> 17:26.900
You don't need a tank?

17:26.900 --> 17:32.860
No. After all, tanks <i>say</i> they're protecting 
their party members while doing nothing.

17:32.860 --> 17:33.900
He's right.

17:32.860 --> 17:36.070
Attackers can handle the tank role.

17:33.900 --> 17:36.070
Evasion tanks are better anyway.

17:36.340 --> 17:38.110
Allow me to be direct.

17:38.110 --> 17:41.530
Lady Nin, will you join our clan?

17:41.870 --> 17:44.800
Your talents are wasted 
in a nameless clan like—

17:44.800 --> 17:46.040
Wait a minute.

17:46.040 --> 17:50.430
We've also been wanting a talented healer
 to help us raid the Keild Labyrinth.

17:50.430 --> 17:51.590
Enough.

17:52.000 --> 17:54.410
I'm not letting either of you have Nin.

17:55.800 --> 18:00.840
Mr. Rud, you wanted an advisor 
for your clan, didn't you?

18:00.840 --> 18:04.270
But you want Nin in exchange for one, right?

18:04.840 --> 18:07.400
I'm sorry, but Nin is a valued friend.

18:07.400 --> 18:10.080
I'm not trading her.

18:10.080 --> 18:11.730
Then, why did you come here?

18:12.440 --> 18:13.690
To form an alliance.

18:13.960 --> 18:16.900
An alliance? With our major clans?

18:16.900 --> 18:18.990
Isn't his clan a small backwater one?

18:18.990 --> 18:21.030
He's merely a tank, too.

18:21.030 --> 18:22.580
What a joke.

18:23.770 --> 18:27.330
I can't trust a clan led by a tank.

18:27.770 --> 18:31.000
Lady Nin, are you sure he's the one you want?

18:32.370 --> 18:34.270
Yes, of course.

18:38.120 --> 18:40.590
He's the world's strongest tank!

18:45.180 --> 18:46.710
May I borrow that?

18:49.760 --> 18:53.820
We came here to raid the Keild Labyrinth.

18:54.320 --> 18:56.610
We are stronger than anyone here.

18:56.610 --> 18:58.380
Laugh if you want.

18:58.990 --> 19:02.490
But anyone who does will regret it.

19:02.490 --> 19:04.740
I'll prove your expectations wrong.

19:05.220 --> 19:10.920
We will reach the 51st floor 
and below of the Keild Labyrinth

19:10.920 --> 19:13.790
that not even the 
two major clans could clear.

19:16.640 --> 19:19.970
Well, well. You're a spirited young man.

19:20.640 --> 19:23.010
I love guys like you.

19:23.490 --> 19:27.040
L-Leader! You came to the ball?

19:27.040 --> 19:28.180
Yeah.

19:28.420 --> 19:33.520
Ike, don't underestimate the newbies
 too much. It's a bad habit of yours.

19:33.520 --> 19:34.360
But, sir...

19:34.360 --> 19:36.380
Rud, was it?

19:37.100 --> 19:41.190
I am Gosh, leader of the Black Dragon Fang.

19:41.190 --> 19:42.240
Nice to meet you.

19:42.850 --> 19:43.570
Likewise.

19:45.220 --> 19:46.830
<i>I can tell from his handshake.</i>

19:47.460 --> 19:50.700
<i>He's incredibly powerful.</i>

19:50.700 --> 19:53.460
<i>So this is the leader of 
the Black Dragon Fang?</i>

19:54.810 --> 19:57.820
If he thinks he can raid the labyrinth,

19:57.820 --> 20:00.360
then I'm willing to consider 
an alliance with him.

20:00.360 --> 20:01.930
Go on, say something.

20:03.510 --> 20:07.140
Jeez. I was planning 
to stay out of the spotlight.

20:07.490 --> 20:11.350
Don't be like that, Ms. Lutel, 
leader of the White Tiger Claw.

20:11.920 --> 20:15.270
I'd also be willing to consider 
an alliance with a clan

20:15.270 --> 20:18.820
that says they can conquer the labyrinth.

20:19.840 --> 20:23.200
If they manage it, that is.

20:23.200 --> 20:24.780
Well, you heard her, Rud.

20:26.100 --> 20:28.220
I hope you're not all bark and no bite.

20:30.850 --> 20:33.160
That was a splendid declaration.

20:33.160 --> 20:35.430
Don't remind me.

20:35.430 --> 20:39.130
Anyway, why doesn't everyone 
respect your strength?

20:39.130 --> 20:42.610
Because you typically can't tell how strong 
someone is just by looking at them.

20:42.610 --> 20:47.350
But anyone strong enough should be able
 to recognize that you're exceptional.

20:48.180 --> 20:51.100
Rud, we're gonna conquer that labyrinth.

20:51.880 --> 20:54.810
I won't let their mockery of you stand.

20:55.730 --> 20:57.690
I'm gonna go take a bath!

20:58.680 --> 21:00.880
Try not to bother anyone.

21:00.880 --> 21:02.590
Yeah, yeah, I know.

21:03.150 --> 21:04.170
Master.

21:05.870 --> 21:07.370
You look tired.

21:08.460 --> 21:12.200
It's not often that I speak 
in front of so many people.

21:12.200 --> 21:17.220
But your words were incredible.
 I'm glad you said all that.

21:17.220 --> 21:20.920
You're right. And, um...

21:21.530 --> 21:26.150
Th-Thanks for protecting me like that.

21:26.150 --> 21:27.890
It made me really happy.

21:27.890 --> 21:31.060
Of course. You're a valued friend, after all.

21:32.460 --> 21:34.730
A-Anyway, I just wanted to say that.

21:35.620 --> 21:37.290
I'll see you tomorrow.

21:37.290 --> 21:38.050
Okay.

21:39.520 --> 21:42.230
<i>Not even the two major clans 
could clear the labyrinth.</i>

21:43.060 --> 21:47.200
<i>I doubt it'll be easy, but in order 
to protect my clan and my friends...</i>

21:48.460 --> 21:53.070
<i>I will conquer the Keild Labyrinth.</i>
